{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o038c","title":"诸葛亮出斜谷屯渭南司马懿拒守","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o038c-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"诸葛亮出斜谷屯渭南司马懿拒守","evidence":["mingdi-e-o038c-q"]},{"id":"mantian-a-4fca76cfb816ef6fbf43","label":"正文","text":"青龙二年亮出斜谷田兰坑宣王屯渭南","evidence":["mantian-q-7bf45d197e4f6d06eed9"]},{"id":"huanchen-a-2eb73b74c5dde617b8ae","label":"正文","text":"亮又出斜谷征南上朱然等过荆城","evidence":["huanchen-q-00ca77322e9181c90eb5"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"进军","evidence":["mingdi-e-o038c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"拒敌","evidence":["mingdi-e-o038c-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0046","role":"军已过荆城","evidence":["huanchen-q-00ca77322e9181c90eb5"]}],"place":{"text":"斜谷、渭南","evidence":["mingdi-e-o038c-q"]},"time":{"year":234,"label":"青龙二年夏四月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o037","basis":"青龙二年夏四月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o038c-q","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o038c-q","source_order":[3,251,"O038c"],"order":852}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0046","name":"朱然","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-00ca77322e9181c90eb5","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-2306f8c5823cba4a18da","layer":"original","quote":"亮又出斜谷","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":5,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-7bf45d197e4f6d06eed9","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-02e3b2481abce163dcd4","layer":"original","quote":"青龙二年，诸葛亮出斜谷，并田于兰坑〖30〗。是时司马宣王屯渭南","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":288,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o038c-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-eaefc3069853442c7a7a","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，大疫。崇华殿灾。丙寅〖9〗，诏有司以太牢告祠文帝庙。追谥山阳公为汉孝献皇帝，葬以汉礼。﹝一﹞是月，诸葛亮出斜谷，屯渭南；司马宣王率诸军拒之。诏宣王：“但坚壁拒守，以挫其锋；彼进不得志，退无与战；久停则粮尽，虏略无所获：则必走矣。走而追之，以逸待劳：全胜之道也。”﹝二﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":250,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
